# Sanitized env copied into every agent worktree as `.env`.
#
# NEVER copy a repo's real .env here. An agent can read, print, and commit this file.
# Only keys that are safe in the hands of an AI agent belong here: throwaway dev
# credentials, local/test service URIs, feature flags. An empty file is fine.
#
#   cp .env.sandbox.example projects/<project>/.env.sandbox
#   cp .env.sandbox.example projects/<project>/.env.sandbox.<repo>    # per-repo override
#
# Lookup order per repo: .env.sandbox.<repo> then .env.sandbox. Startup fails when
# neither exists for a repo the run targets.

NODE_ENV=development
# ...add only the keys agents need to typecheck, lint, and run tests
